            0.14
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7.3 How Does the Interparticle Spacing Differ in the Three States of Matter?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.155,
            0.742,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What role does the interparticle spacing play in determining the properties of each state (solid, liquid, and gas)?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.195,
            0.743,
            0.233
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "perform",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the following activities to find answers to these questions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.251,
            0.537,
            0.275
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 7.6: Let us experiment"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.288,
            0.743,
            0.326
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Take a syringe without a needle. Pull the plunger of the syringe outwards in a fully extended position (Fig. 7.9a)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.327,
            0.743,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Place your thumb over the open end of the syringe to prevent the air present inside the syringe from escaping (Fig. 7.9b)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.364,
            0.694,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Push the plunger slowly and steadily inward (Fig. 7.9c)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.391,
            0.704,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
