              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(b) Placing thumb"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image_footnote",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.571,
                0.582,
                0.707,
                0.614
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(c) Pushing the plunger inwards"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.62,
                0.622,
                0.637
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 7.9: The syringe piston in different positions"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.642,
            0.38,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z What do you observe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.666,
            0.743,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As you do this, you will notice that the volume of air inside the syringe decreases."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.706,
            0.728,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What can we say about the behaviour of gas in the syringe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.727,
            0.744,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When you compress the air by pushing the plunger, the particles are forced to come closer. This shows that the gas particles have a lot of space between them in their natural state, and this space can be reduced by applying external pressure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.802,
            0.743,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If you stop pushing the plunger, the gas particles spread, and the plunger moves back to its original position."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.842,
            0.585,
            0.861
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Repeat this activity using water and observe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.862,
            0.727,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You would observe that water is practically incompressible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.884,
            0.743,
            0.922
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us perform another activity to learn about the interparticle spaces in liquids."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 24,
